um that resulted in a lot of referrals to the um community service officers the CSOS We also um in talking with Chief Francisco within the first month or so of this ordinance going into place we had an individual who went in and got 15 permits at one time Um because it's cheaper to get 15 permits um and at $75 for those 15 permits than it is to pay for um parking his oversized vehicle in a um commercial entity or lot or taking it off the street So um there were and we also the third um issue was we have a a camper that even as we speak today is sitting on College Drive and um

