now and um part of that is that we are getting ready to go into the period of time which is 5 days but before Memorial Day till 5 days after Labor Day when these oversized vehicles are um allowed to be um on the streets Um but with that in mind we wanted to make sure that people knew what the um guidelines would be coming back um after Labor Day and before they're purchasing these um oversized vehicles for recreational purposes Um as the you wouldn't know it today from the weather but as the weather gets nicer and people are wanting to do camping um we wanted people to know what uh kind of a playing field they were going to have come fall And

