as a part of that federal administration railroad crossing elimination program grant we are required by federal statute to enter into a formal agreement with the BNSF railway Um as the cost of this is undetermined yet but I've had some discussion with the consultant This is this is that the parameter that we were kind of stuck on for a while What we've come up to now is based on conversations with the railroad and our consultant that this will approximately be 10% of the assessed value or the appraised value of the area that we're using within the corridor We are advancing a an appraisal process but there is no money exchange with this agreement As I've stated before this will be part of the construction and

